==Battleground==
*2 [[Pigge Victorious|Pigge Victoriouses]] spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bang-Bang]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Gary Gory|Gary Gories]] spawn, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
**4 [[Pigge Victorious|Pigge Victoriouses]] spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Every enemy in this stage can be stalled endlessly using 3 meatshields, and as such, keeps your backline nice and safe. [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon]] Cat is a rather nice backliner, as is [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie]] if you have her. Red tankers like [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fried Shrimp]] make this stage a breeze.

